# CS4013 UL Student Records System

Group project for CS4013 Software Development Project (AY 2026/27).

## Team
- Person 1: Students, programmes and modules - Pooja
- Person 2: Grades and QCA - Aisha
- Person 3: Progression and exam boards - Alfi
- Person 4: CSV storage, CLI and transcripts - Stephanie

## How to run
1. Keep all .csv files in the same folder as the program.
2. Compile: javac *.java
3. Run: java Main

Requires Java 17 or later.
